otes, escaping comma, quote, backslash, and uppercase consumes exactly one following character without changing mode.\",\n+      \"input\": \"\\\"A\\\\,B\\\\\\\"C\\\\\\\\D\\\\Z\\\",E\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"a,b\\\"c\\\\dz\", \"e\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"all_ordinary_whitespace\",\n+      \"intent\": \"All six ordinary ASCII whitespace characters trim at boundaries and collapse together internally.\",\n+      \"input\": \" \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\fA \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\fB\\f\\u000b\\n\\r\\t \",\n+      \"expected\": [\"a b\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"all_quoted_whitespace\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Quoted whitespace retains all six exact characters and repeated spaces at both label boundaries.\",\n+      \"input\": \"\\\"  \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\fA  \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\f\\\"\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"  \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\fa  \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\f\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"all_escaped_whitespace\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Escaping each of the six whitespace characters protects each exact character and preserves boundary whitespace.\",\n+      \"input\": \"\\\\ \\\\\\t\\\\\\r\\\\\\n\\\\\\u000b\\\\\\fA\\\\ \\\\ \\\\\\t\\\\\\r\\\\\\n\\\\\\u000b\\\\\\f\",\n+      \"expected\": [\" \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\fa  \\t\\r\\n\\u000b\\f\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"ordinary_around_protected_boundaries\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Trim only exterior ordinary whitespace while retaining protected boundary spaces and concatenating uppercase text.\",\n+      \"input\": \" \\t\\\"  \\\"A\\\"  \\\"\\r\\n\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"  a  \"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"protected_breaks_ordinary_runs\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Quoted tabs and an escaped tab each break ordinary runs, which collapse independently on either side.\",\n+      \"input\": \"A \\t\\\"\\t\\t\\\"\\r\\nB,C  \\\\\\t  D\",\n+      \"expected\": [\"a \\t\\t b\", \"c \\t d\"]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"empty_quotes_do_not_break_runs\",\n+      \"intent\": \"Removed empty quote fragments int